  "core_insight_zh": "京张铁路的公共性靠'看得见'建立——铁轨、车站、时刻表每天被市民看见。数据是这一世纪'看不见的公共设施'。公共性=可见性：数据时刻表把每一次数据使用变成时刻表上的一行，市民像看铁路时刻表一样看数据。",
  "core_insight_en": "Jingzhang Railway's publicness lives in what is seen — rails, stations, the timetable. Data is the century's invisible public utility. Publicness equals visibility: the Data Timetable turns every data use into a row on a public board, read like a railway timetable.",
  "display_rule_zh": "每一行显示：数据/提供方/使用方/用途/显示期/保留期/删除要求/显示状态/异议状态/人工复核人——与铁路时刻表的车次/始发/到达/状态同构。",
  "display_rule_en": "Each row shows: data/provider/user/purpose/display period/retention/deletion/display state/objection state/human reviewer — isomorphic to a railway timetable row.",
